<p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;">Hello <%= @user.display_name %>,</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;">You are receiving this email as a reminder to input the case contacts which you have made. You can visit <a href="<%= case_contacts_url %>" style="color:#4f46e5; text-decoration:underline;">this link</a> to edit your case contacts.</p>
<p style="margin:0; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#334155;">If you have any questions, please contact your most recent CASA supervisor for assistance.</p>
